# Suite psg: the PSG register file, then (plans 05-05..05-08) the ports, tone, mixer, noise, envelope,
# sample stream and write log (AUD-01, plan 05-04, A-12).
# Plan 05-04: one id per vector of data/psg/vectors/regs.txt (psg.reg.*, 28) and reset.txt (psg.reset.*, 2),
# evaluated through the memory-system bus against the register-address literal; the register-map,
# reset, bus, no-mirror, purity and guest tests; and the two judge self-controls (psg.judge.*).
# Plan 05-05: the port family (data/psg/vectors/port.txt, psg.port.*, 10), evaluated through the bus READ with
# the pins of the vector's pin key and the direction bits of R7, and its judge self-control.
# The vector families wired into the suite are the ones NOT listed in data/psg/vectors-pending.ids.
